<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>NSAppleScriptEnabled</key>
	<true/>
	<key>OSAScriptingDefinition</key>
	<string>Scriptable</string>
	<!--
		Fork note (com.tobiashochgurtel.TopitFork):

		Upstream ships `SUFeedURL` + `SUPublicEDKey` pointing at lihaoyun6's appcast. Keeping them
		would let Sparkle "update" this fork back into stock Topit, so both keys are removed here
		and the updater is started inert (see Supports/Sparkle.swift).

		To publish updates yourself: generate a Sparkle key pair (`Sparkle/bin/generate_keys`),
		add `SUPublicEDKey` and `SUFeedURL` (raw.githubusercontent.com/<you>/Topit/main/appcast.xml)
		below. The updater picks the feed up automatically on next launch. See docs/fork.md.
	-->
</dict>
</plist>
